\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Spoken Script (Simple & Direct):
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 "Our dataset consists of 62 manually labeled IT companies for training, and a separate, locked batch of 28 companies for testing. To measure our accuracy, we used Root Mean Squared Error, or RMSE, which simply tells us how many points our predictions miss by on average. We started with a basic, hand-coded rule baseline in Experiment 001, which had a high average error of 1.85. Our strict target for this project was to use machine learning to drop this error below 2.0 on the final hidden test set."\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

