\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 System Architecture:
\f1\b0  A strict worker-judge framework where evaluation code and test sets are completely frozen to prevent cheating.\
\ls4\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Isolation Rule:
\f1\b0  The model is reset to a clean snapshot before every single test to prevent features from blending together.\
\ls4\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u9702 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The 5x Alpha Guardrail:
\f1\b0  Automatically blocks and flags runs if the model changes its math settings too drastically to hide data noise.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Spoken Script (Simple & Direct):
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 "To find the best predictive features safely, we built an automated research loop. The core rule of this loop is integrity: the evaluation metrics and the test data are completely frozen so the agent cannot cheat or cause data leaks. The agent is only allowed to modify the model file. We enforced a strict isolation rule: every time the agent tests a new business idea, it must reset the model code to a clean baseline snapshot. We also added a math guardrail: if the model changes its regularization settings by more than 5 times the baseline to mask data noise, the run is automatically blocked and flagged for human review."\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

