\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Spoken Script (Simple & Direct):
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 "This project taught us a profound lesson about doing research with AI agents. Agents are fantastic at fast math, running repetitive simulations, and writing flawless pipeline code. But they completely lack real-world context, making them highly vulnerable to statistical noise in marketing text.\u8232 Our biggest limitation was data collection: by filtering our data too tightly upfront to just Midwest IT companies, we created a low-variance dataset where the rows looked nearly identical. If I restarted this project, I would completely change the design. I would pull a massive, completely unfiltered raw dataset across many industries and locations. This would allow the model to flexibly learn the structural boundaries between different sectors based on an investor's custom thesis, turning this from a rigid script into a highly scalable, intelligent sourcing engine. Thank you, and I am happy to open the floor to your questions."\
